to get a couplle of the early XP levels.  In a game I started
yesterday I explored level 1, cleared it out, then did a cycle
around it looking for newly spawned monsters because I
was still XP 1 and wanted to be XP 2 before going back
down the stairs.  No new monster, so I descended.  In a
game a week ago I was on level 4 for quite some time as
